%%
%% spotxcolor-xespotcolor.sty
%%
%% A drop-in replacement for the legacy `xespotcolor' package (Apostolos
%% Syropoulos, 2014-2021), implemented on top of `spotxcolor'. Existing
%% documents that read
%%   \usepackage[hks,pantone,xcolor]{xespotcolor}
%%   \NewSpotColorSpace{...}  \AddSpotColor{...}  \SetPageColorSpace{...}
%%   \definecolor{X}{spotcolor}{NAME,TINT}   \SpotColor{NAME}{TINT}
%% continue to work unmodified. `spotxcolor' is xcolor-based and
%% multi-engine by design, so the `xcolor' option is accepted for source
%% compatibility but has no effect (xcolor integration is always active).
